@startuml binding_step_6_lifecycle
title Step 6: Wire Lifecycle and Cleanup

state "Created" as created
state "Prepared" as prepared
state "Offered / connected" as active
state "Stopping" as stopping
state "Destroyed" as destroyed

[*] --> created
created --> prepared : construct binding resources
prepared --> active : PrepareOffer / connect
active --> stopping : PrepareStopOffer /\nPrepareDeinitialize
stopping --> destroyed : stop callbacks,\nrelease resources
destroyed --> [*]

note right of stopping
Respect destruction order:
binding callbacks must stop
before service elements disappear.
end note
@enduml
